# Scanned PBR sets: half a gigabyte of CC0 downloads, the folders they unzip to, and every map
# generated from them. All of it rebuilds from the archives with `npx tsx scripts/material-web.ts`
# and `npx tsx scripts/material-gauss.ts`, so none of it belongs in history.
public/materials/
